<title>GREECE: Greece raises 250 bln drachmas from T-bills.</title>
<headline>Greece raises 250 bln drachmas from T-bills.</headline>
<dateline>ATHENS 1997-06-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Greece raised 250 billion drachmas from the sale of 12-month T-bills on Monday, it said in a statement.</p>
<p>&quot;Sales covered expiries of the same amount,&quot; it added.</p>
<p>The 12-month T-bills carried a gross annual rate of 9.60 percent.</p>
<p>--Dimitris Kontogiannis, Athens Newsroom +301 3311812-4</p>
</text>
